sms of functors\nsuch that <MATH_0015>\nfor all <MATH_0016>.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9cbd9c0e9a1da915a04cef6cbf89e0800cec70b1fa190dcc37bada791951abae", "unit_id": "tag:0433:statement"}
